    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A laundry basket is 35 cm across and 45 cm tall. Worked in very thick rope (10-12 mm diameter) on a 12 mm hook, it is large enough for a full wash load and rigid enough to stand unaided. The base is a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "magic-ring-laundry"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "magic ring"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " dc spiral to 35 cm."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Total yardage is around 600 m of thick cotton rope. This is a large project; in super-chunky rope the sides grow at about 7 cm per 5 rounds."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "suppliesCard",
        "attrs": {
          "heading": "Materials",
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "Extra-thick cotton rope (10-12 mm)",
              "qty": "600 m"
            },
            {
              "name": "12 mm crochet hook",
              "qty": "1"
            },
            {
              "name": "Stitch marker",
              "qty": "1"
            },
            {
              "name": "Tapestry needle (large eye)",
              "qty": "1"
            },
            {
              "name": "Scissors",
              "qty": "1 pair"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Base (rounds 1 to 11)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Follow the standard circle increase pattern (+8 dc per round) for 11 rounds to reach 35 cm diameter. (96 dc.)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Fold round"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "blo-laundry"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "BLO fold round"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ": work 1 dc into the back loop only around. (96 dc.)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Sides"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work 1 dc into every stitch in spiral for approximately 32 rounds (45 cm). Sl st to close last round. Fasten off."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Finishing"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Secure tails with "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "weaving-in-ends"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "weaving in ends"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Place the basket upright while damp so the sides dry straight."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Care"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Spot clean. Machine wash only if the rope label allows for a basket of this size. Stand upright to dry."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What to try next"
